Kamakura Prefecture, Kamakura Prefecture,

4
00:00:27,972 --> 00:00:31,133
Kamakura Prefecture,
Kamakura Prefecture, Kamakura Prefecture,

5
00:00:31,183 --> 00:00:33,273
Kamakura Prefecture, Kamakura Prefecture,

6
00:00:33,323 --> 00:00:35,464
Kamakura Prefecture, Kamakura Prefecture,

7
00:00:35,514 --> 00:00:38,664
Kamakura Prefecture,
Kamakura Prefecture, Kamakura Prefecture,

8
00:00:38,714 --> 00:00:40,797
Kamakura Prefecture, Kamakura Prefecture,

9
